    "description": "**Context**\nEmily hit a validation error while creating a new Referrer Account.\n\n**Requirements**\n\n* Reproduce: creating a new Referrer Account throws \"Referrer status is required,\" even though a Referrer Status value is already present/selected on the record.\n* Fix the validation rule/flow so it correctly recognizes the populated Referrer Status field.\n\n**Constraints / Dependencies**\nEmily could not consistently reproduce/validate the issue on her end — get exact repro steps from her before starting the fix (which fields were filled, in what order, which record type).\n\n**Source**\nEmily's written notes, Log Signup > \"Bug when creating a new Account: Referrer - getting error message 'Referrer status is required' but there is a referrer status present. Could not validate the functionality.\" Not found in the 09/23/2026 transcript — sourced from Emily's notes only.",
